# ── Git ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore

# ── .NET build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/publish/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

# ── Node / Web ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**/node_modules/
products/KodaClaw/apps/kodaclaw-web/dist/
products/KodaClaw/apps/kodaclaw-web/test-results/
products/KodaClaw/apps/kodaclaw-desktop/

# ── Tests (not needed at runtime) ────────────────────────────────────────────
products/KodaClaw/tests/

# ── Docs / misc ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
products/KodaClaw/docs/
products/KodaClaw/observability/
products/KodaClaw/extensions/
products/KodaClaw/tasks/
products/KodaClaw/scripts/
**/*.md
# Exception: built-in skill manifests must be included
!**/skills/**/SKILL.md
**/.env*
**/docker-compose*.yml
